</div></div><div class="et_pb_text_1 et_pb_text et_pb_bg_layout_light et_pb_module et_block_module"><div class="et_pb_text_inner"><p style="text-align: justify;">Deliver your message with confidence using our professional teleprompter solutions. From Presidential and Stage TV Teleprompters to iPad Teleprompters, we cater to corporate events, live broadcasts, video shoots, and more.</p>
</div></div></div></div><div class="et_pb_row_inner_1 et_pb_row_inner et_block_row"><div class="et_pb_column_inner_1 et_pb_column_inner et_pb_column et_pb_column_4_4 et-last-child et_block_column et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough"><div class="et_pb_module et_pb_button_module_wrapper et_pb_button_0_wrapper"><a class="et_pb_button_0 et_pb_button et_pb_bg_layout_light et_pb_module et_block_module" href="#our-teleprompters">VIEW TELEPROMPTERS</a></div><div class="et_pb_module et_pb_button_module_wrapper et_pb_button_1_wrapper"><a class="et_pb_button_1 et_pb_button et_pb_bg_layout_light et_pb_module et_block_module" href="#book">BOOK NOW</a></div></div></div><div class="et_pb_row_inner_2 et_pb_row_inner et_block_row"><div class="et_pb_column_inner_2 et_pb_column_inner et_pb_column et_pb_column_4_4 et-last-child et_block_column et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough"><div class="et_pb_text_2 et_pb_text et_pb_bg_layout_light et_pb_module et_block_module"><div class="et_pb_text_inner"><p><strong>Proudly managed by <a href="https://www.videoproductionkl.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Video Production KL Sdn Bhd.</a></strong></p>
</div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="et_pb_section_1 et_pb_section et_section_regular et_block_section"><div class="et_pb_row_0 et_pb_row et_block_row"><div class="et_pb_column_2 et_pb_column et_pb_column_4_4 et-last-child et_block_column et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough"><div class="et_pb_text_3 et_pb_text et_pb_bg_layout_light et_pb_module et_block_module preset--module--divi-text--7811dc15-6873-4610-a224-b0f022a78d92"><div class="et_pb_text_inner"><h2>Why Choose TelePrompter.my?</h2>
</div></div></div></div><div class="et_pb_row_1 et_pb_row et_block_row"><div class="et_pb_column_3 et_pb_column et_pb_column_4_4 et-last-child et_block_column et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough"><div class="et_pb_blurb_0 et_pb_blurb et_pb_bg_layout_light et_pb_blurb_position_left et_pb_module et_block_module"><div class="et_pb_blurb_content"><div class="et_pb_main_blurb_image et_animated"><span class="et_pb_image_wrap et_pb_only_image_mode_wrap"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="https://teleprompter.my/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/3971006-200.png" width="200" height="200" srcset="https://teleprompter.my/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/3971006-200.png 200w, https://teleprompter.my/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/3971006-200-150x150.png 150w" sizes="(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px" class="wp-image-1101" /></span></div><div class="et_pb_blurb_container"><h4 class="et_pb_module_header">Nationwide Coverage</h4><div class="et_pb_blurb_description"><p>We bring our services to you, no matter where you are in Malaysia.</p>
</div></div></div></div><div class="et_pb_blurb_1 et_pb_blurb et_pb_bg_layout_light et_pb_blurb_position_left et_pb_module et_block_module"><div class="et_pb_blurb_content"><div class="et_pb_main_blurb_image et_animated"><span class="et_pb_image_wrap et_pb_only_image_mode_wrap"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="https://teleprompter.my/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/2720319-600-e1733824433700-300x296.png" width="300" height="296" srcset="https://teleprompter.my/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/2720319-600-e1733824433700-300x296.png 300w" class="wp-image-1102" /></span></div><div class="et_pb_blurb_container"><h4 class="et_pb_module_header">Professional Equipment</h4><div class="et_pb_blurb_description"><p>Enjoy crystal-clear displays and seamless functionality.</p>
</div></div></div></div><div class="et_pb_blurb_2 et_pb_blurb et_pb_bg_layout_light et_pb_blurb_position_left et_pb_module et_block_module"><div class="et_pb_blurb_content"><div class="et_pb_main_blurb_image et_animated"><span class="et_pb_image_wrap et_pb_only_image_mode_wrap"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="https://teleprompter.my/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/1280198-200.png" width="200" height="200" srcset="https://teleprompter.my/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/1280198-200.png 200w, https://teleprompter.my/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/1280198-200-150x150.png 150w" sizes="(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px" class="wp-image-1104" /></span></div><div class="et_pb_blurb_container"><h4 class="et_pb_module_header">Custom Solutions</h4><div class="et_pb_blurb_description"><p>Tailored setups to fit your specific needs.</p>
</div></div></div></div><div class="et_pb_blurb_3 et_pb_blurb et_pb_bg_layout_light et_pb_blurb_position_left et_pb_module et_block_module"><div class="et_pb_blurb_content"><div class="et_pb_main_blurb_image et_animated"><span class="et_pb_image_wrap et_pb_only_image_mode_wrap"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="https://teleprompter.my/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/4074663-200.png" width="200" height="200" srcset="https://teleprompter.my/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/4074663-200.png 200w, https://teleprompter.my/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/4074663-200-150x150.png 150w" sizes="(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px" class="wp-image-1105" /></span></div><div class="et_pb_blurb_container"><h4 class="et_pb_module_header">Affordable Rates</h4><div class="et_pb_blurb_description"><p>High-quality services that won’t break the bank.</p>
</div></div></div></div><div class="et_pb_blurb_4 et_pb_blurb et_pb_bg_layout_light et_pb_blurb_position_left et_pb_module et_block_module"><div class="et_pb_blurb_content"><div class="et_pb_main_blurb_image et_animated"><span class="et_pb_image_wrap et_pb_only_image_mode_wrap"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="https://teleprompter.my/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/1326895-200.png" width="200" height="200" srcset="https://teleprompter.my/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/1326895-200.png 200w, https://teleprompter.my/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/1326895-200-150x150.png 150w" sizes="(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px" class="wp-image-1106" /></span></div><div class="et_pb_blurb_container"><h4 class="et_pb_module_header">Expert Support</h4><div class="et_pb_blurb_description"><p>Our team ensures everything runs smoothly from setup to tear down.</p>
