</div></div></div></div></div><div class="et_pb_section_4 et_pb_section et_section_regular et_flex_section"><div class="et_pb_row_4 et_pb_row et_pb_gutters1 et_grid_row" id="gallery"><div class="et_pb_column_6 et_pb_column et_flex_column et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough"><div class="et_pb_image_0 et_pb_image et_pb_module et_flex_module"><a href="https://teleprompter.my/presidential-teleprompter/"><span class="et_pb_image_wrap"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="https://teleprompter.my/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/photo_2026-04-22_11-56-03.jpg" title="photo_2026-04-22_11-56-03" width="1264" height="842" srcset="https://teleprompter.my/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/photo_2026-04-22_11-56-03.jpg 1264w, https://teleprompter.my/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/photo_2026-04-22_11-56-03-980x653.jpg 980w, https://teleprompter.my/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/photo_2026-04-22_11-56-03-480x320.jpg 480w" sizes="(min-width: 0px) and (max-width: 480px) 480px, (min-width: 481px) and (max-width: 980px) 980px, (min-width: 981px) 1264px, 100vw" class="wp-image-1674" /></span></a></div><div class="et_pb_text_5 et_pb_text et_pb_bg_layout_light et_pb_module et_flex_module"><div class="et_pb_text_inner"><p>Presidential Teleprompter</p>
</div></div><div class="et_pb_text_6 et_pb_text et_pb_bg_layout_light et_pb_module et_flex_module"><div class="et_pb_text_inner"><p style="text-align: justify;">Step onto the stage with confidence using our Presidential Teleprompter. Elevate your speeches, presentations, and addresses to a new level of professionalism. This cutting-edge technology ensures seamless delivery, allowing you to maintain eye contact while effortlessly following your script. Command the room with precision and authenticity using our Presidential Teleprompter solution.</p>
<p>2x TSP2-19 Teleprompters<br />2x 19″ LCD Monitors<br />2x 6′ Stands<br />2x 16″ x 17″ Beamsplitter Mirrors<br />1x 4-Port HDMI Splitter<br />3x 25′ HDMI Cables Included<br />1x Laptop with Teleprompter Software<br />2x Teleprompter Operators</p>
<p style="margin-bottom: 15px;"><strong>Transportation : FOC anywhere in Klang Valley</strong></p>
<p></p>
<div style="line-height: 0;">
<p style="font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 5px;"><strong>Rate:</strong></p>
<p style="font-size: 18px;"><strong>RM 2,500</strong>/day</p>
</div>
</div></div><div class="et_pb_group_0 et_pb_group et-last-child et_pb_module et_flex_group et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough"><div class="et_pb_module et_pb_button_module_wrapper et_pb_button_2_wrapper"><a class="et_pb_button_2 et_pb_button et_pb_bg_layout_light et_pb_module et_block_module" href="#book" id="Monitor-Teleprompter">BOOK NOW</a></div><div class="et_pb_group_1 et_pb_group et-last-child et_pb_module et_flex_group et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough"><div class="et_pb_module et_pb_button_module_wrapper et_pb_button_3_wrapper"><a class="et_pb_button_3 et_pb_button et_pb_bg_layout_light et_pb_module et_block_module" href="https://teleprompter.my/presidential-teleprompter/" id="Monitor-Teleprompter">READ MORE</a></div></div></div></div><div class="et_pb_column_7 et_pb_column et-last-child et_flex_column et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough"><div class="et_pb_image_1 et_pb_image et_pb_module et_flex_module"><a href="https://teleprompter.my/stage-tv-teleprompter/"><span class="et_pb_image_wrap"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="https://teleprompter.my/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/photo_2026-04-22_11-56-06.jpg" title="photo_2026-04-22_11-56-06" width="1264" height="842" srcset="https://teleprompter.my/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/photo_2026-04-22_11-56-06.jpg 1264w, https://teleprompter.my/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/photo_2026-04-22_11-56-06-980x653.jpg 980w, https://teleprompter.my/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/photo_2026-04-22_11-56-06-480x320.jpg 480w" sizes="(min-width: 0px) and (max-width: 480px) 480px, (min-width: 481px) and (max-width: 980px) 980px, (min-width: 981px) 1264px, 100vw" class="wp-image-1675" /></span></a></div><div class="et_pb_text_7 et_pb_text et_pb_bg_layout_light et_pb_module et_flex_module"><div class="et_pb_text_inner"><p>Stage TV Teleprompter</p>
</div></div><div class="et_pb_text_8 et_pb_text et_pb_bg_layout_light et_pb_module et_flex_module"><div class="et_pb_text_inner"><p style="text-align: justify;">Stage TV Teleprompter, designed to enhance live presentations by providing seamless, real-time script delivery, ensuring speakers stay on point and engaged with their audience. Positioned discreetly on stage, the teleprompter allows speakers to maintain eye contact with the crowd while comfortably following the script or notes displayed on a high-resolution screen.</p>
<p>2 x 43" Stage TV Teleprompter<br />
2 x TV Stage Bracket Mount<br />
1 x Laptop with Teleprompter Software<br />
1 x 20m HDMI Cable<br />
1 x HDMI Splitter<br />
1 x Operator<br />
1 x Crew</p>
<p style="margin-bottom: 15px;"><strong>Transportation : FOC anywhere in Klang Valley</strong></p>
<p></p>
<div style="line-height: 0;">
<p style="font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 5px;"><strong>Rate:</strong></p>
<p style="font-size: 18px;"><strong>RM 2,100</strong>/day</p>
</div>
</div></div><div class="et_pb_group_2 et_pb_group et-last-child et_pb_module et_flex_group et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough"><div class="et_pb_module et_pb_button_module_wrapper et_pb_button_4_wrapper"><a class="et_pb_button_4 et_pb_button et_pb_bg_layout_light et_pb_module et_block_module" href="#book" id="Monitor-Teleprompter">BOOK NOW</a></div><div class="et_pb_group_3 et_pb_group et-last-child et_pb_module et_flex_group et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough"><div class="et_pb_module et_pb_button_module_wrapper et_pb_button_5_wrapper"><a class="et_pb_button_5 et_pb_button et_pb_bg_layout_light et_pb_module et_block_module" href="https://teleprompter.my/stage-tv-teleprompter/" id="Monitor-Teleprompter">READ MORE</a></div></div></div></div></div><div class="et_pb_row_5 et_pb_row et_pb_gutters1 et_grid_row" id="gallery"><div class="et_pb_column_8 et_pb_column et_flex_column et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough"><div class="et_pb_image_2 et_pb_image et_pb_module et_flex_module"><a href="https://teleprompter.my/monitor-teleprompter/"><span class="et_pb_image_wrap"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="https://teleprompter.my/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/photo_2026-04-22_11-56-08.jpg" title="photo_2026-04-22_11-56-08" width="1338" height="768" srcset="https://teleprompter.my/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/photo_2026-04-22_11-56-08.jpg 1338w, https://teleprompter.my/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/photo_2026-04-22_11-56-08-1280x735.jpg 1280w, https://teleprompter.my/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/photo_2026-04-22_11-56-08-980x563.jpg 980w, https://teleprompter.my/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/photo_2026-04-22_11-56-08-480x276.jpg 480w" sizes="(min-width: 0px) and (max-width: 480px) 480px, (min-width: 481px) and (max-width: 980px) 980px, (min-width: 981px) and (max-width: 1280px) 1280px, (min-width: 1281px) 1338px, 100vw" class="wp-image-1676" /></span></a></div><div class="et_pb_text_9 et_pb_text et_pb_bg_layout_light et_pb_module et_flex_module"><div class="et_pb_text_inner"><p>22" Monitor Teleprompter</p>
</div></div><div class="et_pb_text_10 et_pb_text et_pb_bg_layout_light et_pb_module et_flex_module"><div class="et_pb_text_inner"><p style="text-align: justify;">Unlock your on-screen charisma with our 22" Monitor Teleprompter. Ideal for content creators, anchors, and speakers, this sleek device seamlessly attaches to your existing monitor, transforming it into a discreet teleprompter. Enhance your delivery, maintain engagement, and elevate your communication effortlessly. Elevate your on-camera presence with our user-friendly Monitor Teleprompter solution.</p>
<p>1x 22” Monitor Teleprompter<br />
1x Coated Beam Splitter<br />
1x Frame + Hood<br />
1x Monitor Adjustable Mounting Tray<br />
1x 22″ Monitor<br />
1x 20m HDMI Cable<br />
1x Heavy Duty Tripod<br />
1x Laptop with Teleprompter Software<br />
1x Operator</p>
<p style="margin-bottom: 15px;"><strong>Transportation : FOC anywhere in Klang Valley</strong></p>
<p></p>
<div style="line-height: 0;">
<p style="font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 5px;"><strong>Rate:</strong></p>
<p style="font-size: 18px;"><strong>RM 2,000</strong>/day</p>
</div>
</div></div><div class="et_pb_group_4 et_pb_group et-last-child et_pb_module et_flex_group et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough"><div class="et_pb_module et_pb_button_module_wrapper et_pb_button_6_wrapper"><a class="et_pb_button_6 et_pb_button et_pb_bg_layout_light et_pb_module et_block_module" href="#book" id="Monitor-Teleprompter">BOOK NOW</a></div><div class="et_pb_group_5 et_pb_group et-last-child et_pb_module et_flex_group et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough"><div class="et_pb_module et_pb_button_module_wrapper et_pb_button_7_wrapper"><a class="et_pb_button_7 et_pb_button et_pb_bg_layout_light et_pb_module et_block_module" href="https://teleprompter.my/monitor-teleprompter/" id="Monitor-Teleprompter">READ MORE</a></div></div></div></div><div class="et_pb_column_9 et_pb_column et-last-child et_flex_column et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough"><div class="et_pb_image_3 et_pb_image et_pb_module et_flex_module"><a href="https://teleprompter.my/ultralight-ipad-teleprompter/"><span class="et_pb_image_wrap"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="https://teleprompter.my/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/photo_2026-04-24_03-38-28.jpg" title="photo_2026-04-24_03-38-28" width="1280" height="741" srcset="https://teleprompter.my/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/photo_2026-04-24_03-38-28.jpg 1280w, https://teleprompter.my/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/photo_2026-04-24_03-38-28-980x567.jpg 980w, https://teleprompter.my/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/photo_2026-04-24_03-38-28-480x278.jpg 480w" sizes="(min-width: 0px) and (max-width: 480px) 480px, (min-width: 481px) and (max-width: 980px) 980px, (min-width: 981px) 1280px, 100vw" class="wp-image-1751" /></span></a></div><div class="et_pb_text_11 et_pb_text et_pb_bg_layout_light et_pb_module et_flex_module"><div class="et_pb_text_inner"><p>Ultralight iPad Teleprompter</p>
</div></div><div class="et_pb_text_12 et_pb_text et_pb_bg_layout_light et_pb_module et_flex_module"><div class="et_pb_text_inner"><p style="text-align: justify;">Introducing our Ultralight iPad Teleprompter, the compact solution for polished presentations. Transform your iPad into a teleprompter, seamlessly displaying scripts for confident delivery. Its lightweight and portable design makes it ideal for on-the-go professionals, content creators, and educators. Elevate your communication with the convenience and clarity of our iPad Teleprompter.</p>
<p>1x Teleprompter<br />
1x iPad with Teleprompter App<br />
1x Clear Beam Splitter<br />
1x Frame + Hood<br />
1x Monitor adjustable mounting Tray<br />
1x Tripod<br />
1x Operator</p>
