</div></div></div></div></div><div class="et_pb_column_25 et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_2 et-last-child et_block_column et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough"><div class="et_pb_code_1 et_pb_code et_pb_module"><div class="et_pb_code_inner"><iframe src="https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d5633.926859332218!2d101.66409477324073!3d3.1505766463284632!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x31cc4921456262c1%3A0x638c62f6556ef7d3!2sVideo%20Production%20KL!5e0!3m2!1sen!2smy!4v1748592028404!5m2!1sen!2smy" width="730" height="400" style="border:0;" allowfullscreen="" loading="lazy" referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade"></iframe></div></div></div></div></div><div class="et_pb_section_12 et_pb_section et_section_regular et_block_section"><div class="et_pb_row_11 et_pb_row et_block_row"><div class="et_pb_column_27 et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_2 et_block_column et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough"><div class="et_pb_text_39 et_pb_text et_pb_bg_layout_light et_pb_module et_block_module preset--module--divi-text--7811dc15-6873-4610-a224-b0f022a78d92"><div class="et_pb_text_inner"><h2>Service Terms &amp; Conditions</h2>
</div></div><div class="et_pb_text_40 et_pb_text et_pb_bg_layout_light et_pb_module et_block_module preset--module--divi-text--7811dc15-6873-4610-a224-b0f022a78d92"><div class="et_pb_text_inner"><ol>
<li style="text-align: justify"><strong>Payment terms</strong>
<ul>
<li style="font-weight: 400"><span style="font-weight: 400"><strong>70%</strong> payment for booking fee (12 hours before start of the event)</span></li>
<li style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-weight: 400"><strong>30%</strong> remaining payment before start of event<br /></span><span style="font-weight: 400"><strong>Notes:</strong><br />- </span><span style="font-weight: 400"><strong>Weekend / Public Holiday Work:</strong> A 20% surcharge will apply for any jobs scheduled on weekends or public holidays.<br />- <strong>Transportation Costs:</strong> For locations outside of Kuala Lumpur and Selangor, additional transportation costs will be incurred, calculated based on mileage.<br />- <strong>Accommodation:</strong> If required, accommodation costs for jobs outside of Kuala Lumpur and Selangor will be added to the overall charges.</span></li>
</ul>
</li>
<li style="text-align: justify">TelePrompter.my reserves the right to withhold all product and services if  payment is not received in full.</li>
<li style="text-align: justify">For rehearsals scheduled for the day before the event, an additional 50% charge of the selected package will apply.</li>
<li style="text-align: justify"><span style="font-weight: 400">Kindly note that there will be </span><span style="font-weight: 800">no refunds</span><span style="font-weight: 400"> issued for any cancellations.</span></li>
<li style="text-align: justify">Any damages to the items will result in additional costs, which will be borne by the client.</li>
<li style="text-align: justify">Please note that all teleprompters are subject to availability. To secure one, we strongly recommend booking in advance.</li>
</ol>
</div></div></div><div class="et_pb_column_28 et_pb_column et_pb_column_1_2 et-last-child et_block_column et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough"><div class="et_pb_text_41 et_pb_text et_pb_bg_layout_light et_pb_module et_block_module preset--module--divi-text--7811dc15-6873-4610-a224-b0f022a78d92" id="book"><div class="et_pb_text_inner"><h2>Enquiry Form</h2>
</div></div><div class="et_pb_code_3 et_pb_code et_pb_module"><div class="et_pb_code_inner"><iframe loading="lazy" src="https://forms.monday.com/forms/embed/875c7b5cd890890ea0a0b3a58d8d334e?r=use1" width="950" height="1400"></iframe></div></div></div></div></div>
